zindan mein matam hai masoom sakina ka<br>
ghurbat ke andhere mein ek hashr sa hai barpa<br>
<br>
1. bano ne kaha rokar kyon chup hain meri bachi<br>
tadpao na youn maa ko awaz to do bibi<br>
utho mein badal daloo yeh qoon bhara kurta<br>
<br>
2. aye tashna dahan beti ab neend se uth jaoo<br>
kaano ka lahoo ponchoo godi meri aaoo<br>
aise to koi maa ko bechain nahi karta<br>
<br>
3. kaise yeh tamachey the hain gaal abhi zaqmi<br>
kano se abhi tak hai allah lahoo jari<br>
hain nanhi si gardan par rassi ka nasha kaisa<br>
<br>
4. kyon apne chacha ko tu ab yaad nahi karti<br>
baba ke liye kyon ab faryaad nahi karti<br>
hai tauq-e-salasal mein bechain tera bhaiya<br>
<br>
5. asghar bhi nahi mera dil kaise main behlaoo<br>
hai aag kaleje mein kaise main sukoo paon<br>
ab tu hi bata mujhko kaise main jiyoo tanha